  )

  (text "6x G5LE-1-DC12 relays, 2N7002K low-side drivers, SS34 flyback. GEN/MAINS contactor contacts are VOLT-FREE; panel wiring must also hardware-interlock the contactors."
    (at 20 18 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 023a768a-098a-438a-90be-0fa2287a2cc2)
  )
  (text "J8 pin 1 = OUT_COM, the common contact supply. The INSTALLER feeds it from a fused source; it is NOT this board's rail, so no field current crosses the PCB."
    (at 12 26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left))
    (uuid b10ed2e0-138f-49d1-84cd-00ae7e2edb9e)
  )
  (text "J8: 1,6=OUT_COM 2=FUEL(ECU enable) 3=START 4=AUX1 5=AUX2"
    (at 12 36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left))
    (uuid 4311e656-fbe2-495e-baf7-56bcce49a021)
  )
  (text "START is PILOT ONLY - drive an external starter relay coil. A 12V starter solenoid pulls 20-40A; these contacts are 8A DC."
    (at 12 40 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left))
    (uuid a7f33997-93c3-4ef4-94f8-b77ec9091978)
  )
  (text "J15: GEN COM/NO, MAINS COM/NO (volt-free contactor pairs)."
    (at 14 140 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left))
    (uuid ae3ce324-df0b-475b-a01f-0fda9d4d1a0c)
  )
  (text "Separate block from J8: the two contactor coil circuits ride"
    (at 14 144 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left))
    (uuid 7724a6df-5114-4812-9113-d48dbe65ca26)
  )
  (text "different AC sources; 8-pole body, odd poles wired (creepage)."
    (at 14 148 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left))
    (uuid 0e280dd7-f1eb-485a-b793-b18f196067f8)
  )
  (text "K1 FUEL = run-enable: drives the engine-ECU enable input (CRDi) or the fuel solenoid (legacy). K5/K6 AUX are configurable, defaulting to horn and preheat."
    (at 20 290 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left))
    (uuid cda7575e-0f49-43d1-b113-37d3ee35d5fc)
  )

